WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV v3.0 — eco-compute (45s) Narrator Nylo

1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:07.793
First, every calculation is a physical event where flipping silicon switches spends real energy in joules.

2
00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:15.890
Second, honest hardware audits separate wire current sensors from chip counters, while sleeping between real jobs.

3
00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:24.917
Third, single-cycle Boolean lookup circuits replace heavy decimal arithmetic on repeated checks with tiny hardware steps.

4
00:00:25.357 --> 00:00:32.482
Leaving processor clocks spinning between requests is like burning stadium floodlights in an empty park all night,

5
00:00:32.482 --> 00:00:35.670
then firing a jet engine just to check a door lock.

6
00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:42.704
Sleeping quietly until real events arrive, evaluating rules in one-cycle lookup circuits,

7
00:00:42.704 --> 00:00:47.593
and metering wire current directly turns code into honest physics.
